<title>POLAND: BIG plans new share issue.</title>
<headline>BIG plans new share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA (BIG) plans a new share issue ex rights, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>BIG said the new issue would be voted at the bank's shareholders meeting on March 25.</p>
<p>BIG did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
